WEBVTT

00:03:56.782 --> 00:04:00.814
If we cut all the complexity away,

00:04:00.814 --> 00:04:04.193
we have the problem of scale.

00:04:04.193 --> 00:04:07.304
We can't scale.

00:04:07.304 --> 00:04:10.231
We can make progress. We can show benefits.

00:04:10.231 --> 00:04:13.559
We can show results. We can make things better.

00:04:13.559 --> 00:04:17.837
We're helping. We're doing better. We're doing good.

00:04:17.837 --> 00:04:20.191
We can't scale.

00:04:20.191 --> 00:04:25.157
We can't make a large-scale impact on these problems.

00:04:25.157 --> 00:04:26.991
Why is that?

00:04:26.991 --> 00:04:30.581
Because we don't have the resources.